    },
    {
      "id": "act1-vs-act2",
      "title": "Act 1 Was Technology-Out; Act 2 Is Customer-Back",
      "objective": "Create a two-column comparison contrasting Act 1 (foundation models as the entire solution, novelty demos, lightweight wrappers, poor retention) versus Act 2 (foundation models as a piece of a comprehensive solution, new editing interfaces, multi-modal workflows, end-to-end problem solving). Reference Harvey, Glean, Character, and Ava as Act 2 exemplars."
